## Mental Health Disclaimer

This article is for educational purposes only and is not a substitute for professional diagnosis, treatment, or medical advice. Seasonal mood changes can have different causes. A qualified health care or mental health professional can help assess your symptoms and discuss appropriate treatment options.

If you are experiencing thoughts of suicide or self-harm, or believe you may be in immediate danger, seek urgent support. In the United States, call or text 988 for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. Call 911 or visit an emergency department if there is immediate danger.

